    fix(lane_target): enforce intra-family repo_url agreement (CF-091)
    
    repo-url --row now compares each satellite's repo_url with its family primary and
    fails with exit 4 naming both lanes when two rows of one family carry different
    roots; single-target output is unchanged. A committed census records the live
    rejection classes and totals and a waiver file carries the operator-owned
    remainder with an owner and re-check date.
    
